Uniform Type Description <code>chroma_AudioFFT[8]</code> <code>float[8]</code> Eight log-spaced FFT band magnitudes covering 20 Hz to 20 kHz; element 0 is the lowest band, element 7 is the highest <p>The <code>chroma_AudioFFT</code> array binding was consolidated from a transitional split-vec4 spelling (<code>chroma_AudioFFTLow</code> for bands 0..3, <code>chroma_AudioFFTHigh</code> for bands 4..7) once the multipass scheduler grew a <code>FloatArray</code> uniform variant. GLSL authors declare the array directly:</p> <pre><code>uniform float chroma_AudioFFT[8];

// later in main():
float bass = chroma_AudioFFT[0] + chroma_AudioFFT[1];
float treble = chroma_AudioFFT[6] + chroma_AudioFFT[7];
</code></pre>
